          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP341 Mayerthorpe

N53° 57.197’ W115° 07.808’&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mrs BVPete and I have wanted to see the memorial to the fallen Mounties in Mayerthorpe ever since it was created. Today was the day and we both found it to be very moving, brave men and women doing a tough job.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The drive to the cap was without incident and the required photo was taken.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for posting this cap ofth, in this town which suffered such a terrible tragedy.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
