          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP341 Mayerthorpe

?Posted: N53 57.197  W115 07.805?

GPSr: N53 57.197  W115 07.805

?Elevation: 732m&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ever thankful for the routing from the automotive GPS, I was able to navigate the quiet streets of Mayerthorpe over to the tracks on the edge of town and make a quick find on this one. I guess I'm lucky it was a Sunday as there was quite a few piece of heavy equipment very close to the cap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap!&lt;/p&gt;

